# Security & Intellectual Property

## Public Repository Policy

This repository is a public technical showcase of Quantech — an AI-powered B2B sales automation platform.

To protect users, customers and proprietary technology, production-sensitive components are intentionally excluded from this repository.

## Protected Components

The following are never published:

- API keys, tokens and credentials
- Environment variables and `.env` files
- Customer or business data
- Authentication secrets
- Database credentials
- Internal AI prompts and configurations
- Private CRM integrations
- Production infrastructure configuration
- Proprietary production source code

## Public Components

This repository may contain:

- Product architecture
- Technical documentation
- Non-sensitive code samples
- API/interface examples
- Demo components
- Integration specifications
- Product workflow documentation

## Data Protection

Quantech is designed with security and data privacy in mind. Sensitive customer information must not be committed to public repositories or exposed through demo environments.

## Responsible Disclosure

If a potential security issue is discovered, please report it privately to the Quantech team rather than publishing sensitive technical details publicly.

## Disclaimer

The public repository represents selected components of the Quantech project and does not contain the complete production system.
